######################



PATTERN NounTimeVanAdvStem
NounTimeVanAdv AdvZero

PATTERN NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem
NounTimeVanAdvStem SubstZero NouNinflBoundary
[երբ<prn>:երբ] ([<rel>:]|[<itg>:])   SubstZero NouNinflBoundary 

PATTERN NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem
NounTimeVanHimaDerived SubstZero NouNinflBoundary

PATTERN NounTimeVanStemBaseNoOrYesU
NounTimeVan 
NounTimeVanBase
NounTimeVanU 
NounTimeVanUReducedBase 

NounTimeVanIrigunBase

PATTERN NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun
NounTimeVan
NounTimeVanReduced
NounTimeVanU 
NounTimeVanUReducedReduced 

NounTimeVanIrigunReduced

PATTERN NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithoutIrigun
NounTimeVan
NounTimeVanReduced
NounTimeVanU 
NounTimeVanUReducedReduced 

PATTERN NounTimeVanStemReducedYesU
NounTimeVanU  
NounTimeVanUReducedReduced  

PATTERN NounDeclIrregularTimeVan
#optional normal case
#ժամ takes the above and dative ու

# մահ ամիս
NounTimeVanStemBaseNoOrYesU NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 (Def|Poss)? 
# մահվա  ամսվա
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa  
# definite մահ-վա-ն մահ-վան-ս ամս-վա-ն ամս-վան-ս
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Poss
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa Def  
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Def # Dir/LR
# մահու ամսու
NounTimeVanStemReducedYesU  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseDefUDeclensionWithOvertcase # Dir/LR
# մահվան
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan # Dir/LR

# մահվանից ամսվանից իրիկվանից
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Poss?
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Def? # Dir/LR
# ամսից
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithoutIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 AblReg (Def|Poss) # Dir/LR
# ամսով ամսում
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithoutIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Poss?
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithoutIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Def? # Dir/LR
# իրիկունով
NounTimeVanIrigunBase NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Poss?
NounTimeVanIrigunBase NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Def? # Dir/LR

# մահվամբ
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanInsVamp (Def|Poss)? # Dir/LR 
# մահվա-ս
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun  NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa Poss # Dir/LR

# ամիսի ամսի, զատիկի զատկի
NounTimeVanStemBaseNoOrYesU NZero NouNinflBoundary  CaseDefIDeclensionWithOvertcase # Dir/LR
NounTimeVanStemBaseNoOrYesU NZero NouNinflBoundaryRed  CaseDefIDeclensionWithOvertcase # Dir/LR

#Plural
NounTimeVanStemBaseNoOrYesU NZero NouNinflBoundary RegNounPluralFormDeclension 


#Singular attributive
#The ուանէ form is preferably treated as attributive
NounTimeVanStemReducedNoOrYesUWithIrigun NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 AttributiveVan





#For irregulars among the time words
#For irregulars derived from adverbs like այսօր
#Bare adverb
NounTimeVanAdvStem
#Without case, but with definite
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NouNinflBoundary NSg0 (Def|Poss)
#With case այսօրվա
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Poss
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa Def  
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Def # Dir/LR
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan # Dir/LR
# այսօրվանից 
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Poss?
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Def? # Dir/LR
# այսօրով
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Poss?
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Def? # Dir/LR

# այսօրի
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseDefIDeclensionWithOvertcase # Dir/LR

#Attributive
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem NSg0 AttributiveVan

#Plural
NounTimeVanAdvNominalizedStem RegNounPluralFormDeclension 


#For irregular հիմիկվա from հիմա
NounTimeVanHimaBase AdvZero
# հիման
NounTimeVanHimaBase AdvZero SubstZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 NouNinflBoundary (Def|Poss)? 
# հիմիկվա
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Poss
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVa Def  
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan Def # Dir/LR
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan # Dir/LR
# հիմիկվանից 
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Poss?
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 CaseTimeVanDatGenSuffixVan AblReg Def? # Dir/LR
# հիմիկով
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Poss?
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 InsReg|LocReg Def # Dir/LR

#singular attributive
NounTimeVanAdvHimaDerivedNominalizedStem NSg0 AttributiveVan





