NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseDefIDeclension # Dir/LR

#Irregular plural and irregular case մարդիկ մարդկանց մարդկանցից
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary NPlIrregIk  (Def|Poss)? 
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary PlDatGenIrregularKAnts (Def|Poss)? 
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary PlDatGenIrregularKAnts CaseRegIObliqueWithoutGenAndDefPoss
#regularized plural and reguarlized case մարդերի, մարդիկից
NounIrregMan NZero  NouNinflBoundary RegNounPluralFormDeclension  # Dir/LR
NounIrregMan NZero  NouNinflBoundary NPlIrregIk CaseDefIDeclension  # Dir/LR

#unmodeled plural possessive!	#regularized plural possessive մարդերնիս
#unmodeled plural possessive!	NounIrregMan NZero	 NouNinflBoundary NSg0|NPlReg  PossPl CaseRegPostPluralPoss? Def|Poss  # Dir/LR
#unmodeled plural possessive!	NounIrregMan NZero  NouNinflBoundary NSg0|NPlReg  InsReg PossPl  Def|Poss	 # Dir/LR
#unmodeled plural possessive!	#irregular plural possessive մարդիկնիս մարդոցնիս մարդոցովնիս մարդոցմովնիս
#unmodeled plural possessive!	NounIrregMan NZero	 NouNinflBoundary NPlIrregIk  PossPl CaseRegPostPluralPoss? Def|Poss
#unmodeled plural possessive!	NounIrregMan NZero  NouNinflBoundary  PlDatGenIrregularOts CaseBoundaryM? InsReg PossPl  Def|Poss

#attributive
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 AttributiveGenUDef|AttributiveInst  
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 AttributiveGenIDef  # Dir/LR
NounIrregMan NZero NouNinflBoundary  AttributiveKAnts 



#տիկին
#regular caseless  տիկին
NounIrregWomanBase NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 (Def|Poss)? 
#regular dative case and oblique տիկինի տիկինից
NounIrregWomanBase NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 CaseDefIDeclension  # Dir/LR
#irregular dative case տիկնոջ and oblique տիկնոջից
NounIrregWomanReducedSg NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 DatGenArchaicOch (Def|Poss)?
NounIrregWomanReducedSg NZero NouNinflBoundary NSg0 DatGenArchaicOch CaseRegIObliqueWithoutGenAndDefPoss

#regularized plural and reguarlized case տիկինների
NounIrregWomanBase NZero  NouNinflBoundary RegNounPluralFormDeclension # Dir/LR
#Irregular plural and irregular case տիկնայք տինանց  տիկնանցից
NounIrregWomanReducedPl NZero NouNinflBoundary [<pl>:այք]  (Def|Poss)? 
