#Irregulars infixed i-theme
VerbRootNelHye(1)   VZero VerbRootNelHye(2):    ThE  #  անցնիլ group from Boyacioglu
VerbRootNelHye(1)   VZero VerbRootNelHye(2): (EmptyNasal  ThE)?  #   Dir/LR   to capture variation in theme-less or infix-less
VerbRootNelTogHye(1)   VZero VerbRootNelTogHye(2): (EmptyNasal  ThE)?  #   Dir/LR   to capture variation in theme-less or infix-less

# VerbRootCilV(1)|VerbRootCilC(1)   VZero VerbRootCilV(2):|VerbRootCilC(2):     # կպչիլ group from Boyacioglu


VerbRootCelHye(1) EmptyAffr VZero VerbRootCelHye(2):  ThE  		#  դպչել 
VerbRootCelHye(1) EmptyAffr? VZero VerbRootCelHye(2): ThE? #   Dir/LR   to capture variation in theme-less or infix-less

#Irregular infixed non-i-theme

VerbRootNelNale(1)  VZero VerbRootNelNale(2):  ThE  #իջնել իջնալ
