PATTERN Past
#Past
VerbStemE ThE Aor PastPrimAgr Indc0
VerbStemE PastAgrGoNo3Sg Indc0 # Dir/LR     for optional գրինք
VerbStemA ThA Aor PastPrimAgr Indc0 


