CausativeVerbRootOrthographicAffr VZero CausOrthographicAffrPastHye ThE Aor PastAgrYes3SgZero Indc0 #   [<caus_listed>:] 
CausativeVerbRootOrthographicAffr VZero CausOrthographicAffrPastHye ThE Aor PastAgrGoNo3Sg Indc0 #  Dir/LR [<caus_listed>:] 



